{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2021-03", "window": 3, "start_date": 1615852800, "end_date": 1616543999, "month_true_total": 58, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:52:43 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "88949652", "author": {"steamid": "76561198875020112", "personaname": "Damocles", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198875020112/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 1365, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 550, "last_played": 1616887826, "avatar": "9cc55b5091bf30601d83f6f2d913cfd520b169ca"}, "language": "english", "review": "I still didnt finished it yet but ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ what a master piece\nI just love it", "timestamp_created": 1616513139, "timestamp_updated": 1616513139, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493207335472106934", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88946343", "author": {"steamid": "76561199123764072", "personaname": "MMCOOLMATE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199123764072/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5863, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3175, "last_played": 1729620922, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Multifaceted story line. Side stories are refreshing.\n", "timestamp_created": 1616509279, "timestamp_updated": 1616509279, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88920766", "author": {"steamid": "76561198241781258", "personaname": "Sabertooth", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198241781258/", "num_games_owned": 202, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 2760, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1376, "last_played": 1631746200, "avatar": "b210337ee91bf958528ebb79513ae151a322330f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Years of plot and character development get boiled down to different explosion colors depending on how much you played the multiplayer. Yes, that's right, the resolution to the story has more to do with the arcade mode ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ than the actual single player campaign.\n\n♥♥♥♥ you EA.\n\nIn addition, the game is an extremely obvious console port. Use, sprint, get in cover, leave cover, roll, jump, and climb are all bound to the SAME ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ KEY. Half the time walking is faster than sprinting because if you stray too close to one of the countless cover spots, you'll get sucked into it and then roll around like an armadillo as you angrily mash the leave cover key. I don't know how they managed it, but somehow the newest game has more clunky controls than the oldest. \nSpeaking of the oldest, there is also no way to holster your weapon, a feature that was present in both ME1 and ME2. \n\nOnce again, ♥♥♥♥ EA and ♥♥♥♥ Bioware. Go play ME2 instead, it's a far better game in every possible way.", "timestamp_created": 1616466779, "timestamp_updated": 1616466779, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.481475532054901123", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88917546", "author": {"steamid": "76561199054698142", "personaname": "erick_lankford", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199054698142/", "num_games_owned": 136, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 122, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 31, "last_played": 1654745392, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is a waste of money.  I learned to be content with the version that I have on my playstation 3. The playstation 3 version may crash at some points but it runs consistently. It was running fine and all of a sudden it would not run.  I have tried reinstalling the program and I tried verifying the data integrity and non of it worked. I will never purchase anything through EA origins ever. I cannot see how a company can sell products and do not offer support in case anything goes wrong.  Mass effect 3 is a great game but this version is not good.", "timestamp_created": 1616461120, "timestamp_updated": 1616461120, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.507427692413330078", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88865885", "author": {"steamid": "76561198173436854", "personaname": "BotRyan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198173436854/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 843, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 841, "last_played": 1667857300, "avatar": "8b84adbdb97b0f57819150d36cc300715d8ba5c5"}, "language": "english", "review": "don't buy it, it wont launch steam and origin wont fix the issue so until they do don't waste your time!", "timestamp_created": 1616381396, "timestamp_updated": 1616381396, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false